  )
  (text "Prototype on JLCPCB with LCSC-sourced parts. The dashed box is the FIPS 140-3 module's physical boundary and tamper-evident region (doc/fips.md, boundary B): the FPGA, whose loader domain is the module's logic, the ST33KTPM2X TPM (an embedded validated module, CMVP #5570) and the QSPI flash. Everything from the RMII pins outward is untrusted." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12 17 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left))
    (uuid "56e010c0-52df-45b4-932c-ee7fcdb1eb00")
